{"day":9,"title_ko":"월요일 아침, 사무실에서","title_en":"Monday morning at the office","setting_ko":"월요일 아침 사무실에서 마이크와 주말 이야기","grammar":"past_simple","cast":[{"name":"Mike","me":false},{"name":"Jiwoo","me":true}],"lines":[{"n":1,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"Morning, Jiwoo! Did you sleep okay?","sp":"Mornin', Jiwoo! Didja sleep okay?","hk":"모닌, Jiwoo! 디쥬 슬립 오케이?","ko":"Jiwoo 씨, 좋은 아침! 잘 잤어요?","red":[{"w":"Did you","h":"Didja","k":"디쥬","r":"did_you"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d009/l01_","gap":600},{"n":2,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Not really. I didn't sleep well last night.","sp":"Not really. I didn' sleep well las' night.","hk":"낫 륄리. 아이 디든 슬립 웰 래스 나잇.","ko":"별로요. 어젯밤에 잠을 잘 못 잤어요.","red":[{"w":"didn't","h":"didn'","k":"디든","r":"t_drop"},{"w":"last night","h":"las' night","k":"래스 나잇","r":"t_drop"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d009/l02_","gap":600},{"n":3,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"Oh no. Did you have breakfast?","sp":"Oh no. Didja have breakfast?","hk":"오 노. 디쥬 해브 브렉퍼스트?","ko":"저런. 아침은 먹었어요?","red":[{"w":"Did you","h":"Didja","k":"디쥬","r":"did_you"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d009/l03_","gap":600},{"n":4,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"No, I didn't. I just had coffee.","sp":"No, I didn'. I jus' had coffee.","hk":"노, 아이 디든. 아이 저스 해드 커피.","ko":"아니요. 커피만 마셨어요.","red":[{"w":"just","h":"jus'","k":"저스","r":"t_drop"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d009/l04_","gap":600},{"n":5,"who":"Mike","me":false,"en":"Here, take a muffin. I bought two at the bakery.","sp":"Here, take-a muffin. I bough' two at the bakery.","hk":"히어, 테이커 머핀. 아이 바앗 투 앳 더 베이커리.","ko":"자, 머핀 하나 드세요. 빵집에서 두 개 샀어요.","red":[{"w":"take a","h":"take-a","k":"테이커","r":"linking"},{"w":"bought two","h":"bough' two","k":"바앗 투 (t 멈춤)","r":"t_stop"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d009/l05_","gap":600},{"n":6,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Thanks! What did you do this weekend?","sp":"Thanks! Whadja do this weekend?","hk":"땡스! 와쥬 두 디스 위켄?","ko":"고마워요! 주말에 뭐 했어요?","red":[{"w":"What did you","h":"Whadja","k":"와쥬","r":"what_did_you"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d009/l06_","g